"Calc\", \"Convert\"], \"knowledge_ids\": [\"topology.series_contact_coil.v17\", \"instruction.move.v17\", \"instruction.math_cascade.v17\", \"instruction.convert_divide.v17\", \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"access.multilevel_db_member.v17\"], \"main_branch\": [\"常开(信号数据.风机运行按)→串联级联：CALCULATE(REAL): OUT=(IN1/IN2)*IN3→CONV(Real→Int)→MOVE(风压过渡→QW44)\"], \"network_key\": \"nw2_fan_output_calc\", \"parallel_branches\": [[\"常闭(信号数据.风机运行按)→MOVE(0.0→信号数据.风机控制输出)\"]], \"purpose\": \"风机停止时控制输出清零；然后CALCULATE将风机控制输出(百分比)转换为0~27648的比例值，经RealToInt转换后输出模拟量\", \"required_capabilities\": [\"contact\", \"move\", \"calc\", \"convert\", \"series_flow\", \"topology.series\"], \"selected_knowledge_ids\": [\"topology.series_contact_coil.v17\", \"instruction.move.v17\", \"instruction.math_cascade.v17\", \"instruction.convert_divide.v17\", \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"access.multilevel_db_member.v17\"], \"split_reason\": null, \"status\": \"needs_revision\", \"title\": \"风机输出计算\", \"topology\": {\"description\": \"串联链：常闭触点→MOVE清零→Calc(IN1/IN2)→Calc(IN1*IN3)→Convert→Move输出\", \"kind\": \"series\"}, \"uncovered_capabilities\": [], \"variables\": [\"信号数据.风机运行按\", \"信号数据.风机控制输出\", \"内部数据.风机控制输出值\", \"内部数据.风压过渡\", \"风机控制\"], \"verified_version\": null}, {\"artifact_id\": null, \"artifact_version\": null, \"block_name\": \"FC_FanGasControl\", \"comment\": \"风压≥1.2时接通烧嘴电源\", \"compile_result\": null, \"compiled_at\": null, \"depends_on\": [], \"import_result\": null, \"imported_at\": null, \"instruction_chain\": [\"compare_real_to_coil\"], \"instructions\": [\"Ge(Real)\", \"Coil\"], \"knowledge_ids\": [\"instruction.compare_ge_real_coil.v17\", \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"access.multilevel_db_member.v17\"], \"main_branch\": [\"Ge(REAL): 信号数据.风压测量值 >= 1.2→线圈(烧嘴电源 Q4.6)\"], \"network_key\": \"nw3_gas_ignition\", \"parallel_branches\": [], \"purpose\": \"实时比较风压测量值与1.2巴阈值，达标时驱动烧嘴电源线圈\", \"required_capabilities\": [\"compare.ge\", \"coil\", \"topology.series\"], \"selected_knowledge_ids\": [\"instruction.compare_ge_real_coil.v17\", \"network_text.title_comment.v17\", \"access.multilevel_db_member.v17\"], \"split_reason\": null, \"status\": \"planned\", \"title\": \"燃气开启\", \"topology\": {\"description\": \"REAL大于等于比较器直接驱动线圈\", \"kind\": \"series\"}, \"uncovered_capabilities\": [], \"variables\": [\"信号数据.风压测量值\", \"烧嘴电源\"], \"verified_version\": null}], \"plan_id\": \"ladplan_12c6cc8eaeb26a0b\", \"planned_network_count\": 3, \"replaced_by\": null, \"requested_network_count\": 3, \"requirements\": \"风机燃气控制程序。程序段1：风机输出。串联常开(信号数据.风机运行按)+常闭(信号数据.风机故障反馈)→线圈(Q4.4 风机运行)；然后自动/手动模式选择：手动=FALSE时MOVE(信号数据.风机自动输出→信号数据.风机控制输出)，手动=TRUE时MUL(信号数据.风机手动频率×2.0→信号数据.风机控制输出)。程序段2：风机输出计算。常闭(信号数据.风机运行按)→MOVE(0.0→信号数据.风机控制输出)；然后CALCULATE(REAL)公式OUT=(IN1/IN2)*IN3，IN1=信号数据.风机控制输出，IN2=100.0，IN3=27648.0，输出到内部数据.风机控制输出值；然后CONV(Real To Int)转换内部数据.风机控制输出值→内部数据.风压过渡；最后MOVE(内部数据.风压过渡→QW44 风机控制)。程序段3：燃气开启。REAL>=比较（信号数据.风压测量值 >= 1.2）→ 线圈(Q4.6 烧嘴电源)。\", \"status\": \"active\", \"step_status\": {\"artifact_creation\": \"artifact_created\", \"network_generation\": \"planned\", \"planning\": \"planned\"}, \"target_device\": \"PLC_1\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-31T00:14:46.359567Z\", \"verification_history\": [{\"changed_fields\": [\"instruction_chain\", \"required_capabilities\", \"selected_knowledge_ids\", \"topology\"], \"network_key\": \"nw1_fan_output\", \"operation\": \"revise_network_plan\", \"operation_id\": \"op_ce98aacd89f2adf8\", \"reason\": \"topology.parallel_set_reset.v17 not retrievable; replace with fan_out topology from Powerrail to 3 independent branches\", \"recorded_at\": \"2026-07-31T00:12:27.320548Z\"}, {\"artifact_id\": \"xml_96d618e48be3b25005cccf9d\", \"block_name\": \"FC_FanGasControl\", \"block_type\": \"FC\", \"code\": \"TIA_XML_IMPORT_FAILED\", \"device_name\": \"PLC_1\", \"message\": \"Error when calling method \\'Import\\' of type \\'Siemens.Engineering.SW.Blocks.PlcBlockComposition\\'.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nCannot create the \\'SW.Blocks.CompileUnit\